  Error Message:
   Assert.Equal() Failure: HashSets differ
Expected: [[···], [···]]
Actual:   [[···], [···]]
  Stack Trace:
     at SheepTools.Test.BitArrayComparerTest.BitArrayComparer() in /_/tests/SheepTools.Test/BitArrayComparerTest.cs:line 34
```

.NET version: 6.0.411

[Here's another CI run](https://github.com/eduherminio/SheepTools/actions/runs/5487677039/jobs/9999455528) (using the same .NET version and xunit 2.4.2) that I triggered after the failed one to make sure the results were consistent.
